\fs20\fsmilli10462 Instructional Design mastery begins with understanding the domain. While not domain\
experts, Instructional Designers organize and deliver content to achieve performance\
outcomes. AI can assist as a domain expert and problem solver, enhancing the ID pro-\
cess by providing in-depth knowledge and solutions in various fields. Let's break these\
sublayers down and examine how Instructional Designers can leverage AI.\

\fs31\fsmilli15693 1.1\
