\fs48 \cf3 Navigating multicloud Kubernetes:\
Different roads, same destination\

\fs44 Imagine renting cars in different countries. One has the\
steering wheel on the other side that you are accustomed to,\
another uses a different fuel type, and the rules of the road,\
such as speed limits, signage, and driving customs, are slightly\
different, but you still need to drive safely and reach your\
